   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IDM- GoEthics 2.00 Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the project is to strengthen integrity, transparency, and accountability in Albania to reduce corruption and improve public trust. 
The objective will be achieved throught the following specific outcomes:
Outcome 1: State institutions increased adoption and enhanced implementation of integrity instruments (including in high risk sectors such as public health,
SOEs).
Outcome 2: Civil society and other civic actors strengthen their demand for policy integrity through civic engagement, evidence and advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
